  "detail_text": "This Sources Sought is issued only for information and planning purposes and does not constitute a solicitation. All information received in response to this Sources Sought that is marked as proprietary will be handled accordingly. IAW FAR 15.201(e), responses to this notice are not offers and cannot be accepted by the Government to form a binding contract. Responders are solely responsible for all expenses associated with responding to this Sources Sought. The Bakersfield VA Clinic is part of the VA Greater Los Angeles Healthcare System, which offers primary care, dental care, women s health, physical therapy, mental health, telehealth, and other specialty services. The telehealth clinic has a need for a mobile computer cart that will support many computing solutions to assist patient care. Please see the SOW for the breakdown of the equipment requested.",
